<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Allied Ind shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Allied Ind shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of property and building materials concern Allied Industries Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Shares of Allied Industries ended HK$0.02 higher at HK$1.75 on Friday.</p>
<p>Last week, the company said it was in preliminary talks with independent third parties to raise capital through a placement of shares.</p>
<p>Allied Industries, a subsidiary of Allied Group Ltd, is a property, building materials and manufacturing company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
